error BYN2225: `Box` cannot be formatted

  8 │     print($"{b}");
    │              ^
    │
  help: add `format()`/`formatInto(ref StrBuf)` to `Box`, or use `{x:debug}`

error BYN2225: `Untrusted<string>?` cannot be formatted

  10 │     print($"{o}");
     │              ^ the value is `Untrusted<string>`

error BYN2225: `Map<string, Untrusted<string>>` cannot be formatted

  12 │     print($"{m}");
     │              ^ the value is `Untrusted<string>`

error BYN2225: `List<Untrusted<string>>` cannot be formatted

  14 │     print($"{xs}");
     │              ^^ an element is `Untrusted<string>`
